                "text": "In 2014, I led the effort to establish the Certified Community Behavioral Health Clinic (CCBHC) program through my bill, the Excellence in Mental Health Act. Since then, CCBHCs have proven their ability to close the treatment gap and provide care when and where it's needed most.",
