                "text": "For patients and families facing devastating blood cancers and rare blood disorders, bone marrow and cord blood transplants can offer the best treatment \u2013 and sometimes the only potential for a cure.\n\nBy reintroducing the Stem Cell Therapeutic and Research Reauthorization Act, we are making sure that hope endures \u2013 and that even more families are given the gift of time, healing, and a second chance at life.\n\nhttps://t.co/ZdC1Ou0vjz",
